{"type":"finding","id":"f-iter006-001","iteration":6,"label":"OBSERVED: Review owns findings-first reporting and its own broad code-quality baseline. The author-side quality gate runs after implementation, selects authoring checklists, fixes in-scope gate failures, and leaves findings-only output to review.","sources":[".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-review/SKILL.md",".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-review/assets/code-quality-checklist.md",".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-quality/SKILL.md"]}
{"type":"finding","id":"f-iter006-002","iteration":6,"label":"DERIVED: The checklist names overlap but describe different work: review's asset is a non-security defect baseline, while quality mode's nested checklist is implementation validation and a web-specific review overlay. The root CODE_QUALITY resource map exposes the review checklist, and the hub tie-break ranks sk-code-quality before sk-code-review; explicit separate intents can still form an ordered bundle.","sources":[".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-review/assets/code-quality-checklist.md",".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-quality/assets/code-quality-checklist/overview-header-and-comments.md",".skilled/skills/sk-code/ROUTER.md",".skilled/skills/sk-code/hub-router.json"]}
{"type":"finding","id":"f-iter006-003","iteration":6,"label":"INFERRED: The author-side advisory CODE_QUALITY_RESULT envelope has no documented consumer in the review contract, so the docs do not guarantee that review receives the checks and deferrals already recorded by quality. Runtime pass-through is UNKNOWN and needs a live quality-then-review scenario. Candidate follow-up: accept the envelope as optional read-only context while retaining the independent review baseline. Effort S; risk is trusting stale advisory evidence; needs the live scenario before settling the contract. No hub files are needed for a child-to-child handoff; any routing change must update both hub-router.json and ROUTER.md. This affects the sk-code-quality/sk-code-review sibling handoff; user-authored mode integration is not assessed in Q6.","sources":[".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-quality/SKILL.md",".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-review/SKILL.md"]}
